# Public documentation and screenshot repository: explicit allowlist.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!docs/
!docs/*.md
!docs/third-party/
!docs/third-party/*.txt
!assets/
!assets/logo.png
!assets/screenshots/
!assets/screenshots/*.jpg
!assets/screenshots/*.png
!.github/
!.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/
!.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/*.yml
